<title>FRANCE: Bongrain sales rise 4.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Bongrain sales rise 4.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bongrain SA said on Thursday that its 1996 turnover rose 4.78 percent to 10.4 billion francs.</p>
<p>On a like for-like-basis, turnover was up 3.56 percent, the company said. It added that the effect of foreign exchange on the company's turnover was insignificant.</p>
<p>Bongrain said the turnover figure included operations of units in Poland, the Czech Republic, and Hungary but excluded activities of its Avi-Charente unit -- sold in 1996 -- and the Cie Laitiere Europeene, whose turnover is not consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
